VISUALIZATIONS
--------------
- Time-series graphs
- Heatmaps for errors
- Pie charts for role distribution
- Bar charts for event participation


============================================================
10. INCIDENT RESPONSE
============================================================

INCIDENT WORKFLOW
-----------------
1. Alert triggers
2. Developer reviews logs
3. Identify root cause
4. Patch or rollback
5. Document incident
6. Add new alert or log rule if needed

POST-INCIDENT REVIEW
--------------------
- Review audit logs
- Review cluster events
- Review worker logs
- Update monitoring thresholds


============================================================
11. LOGGING & MONITORING VERSIONING
============================================================

VERSION CONTROL
---------------
- All logging/monitoring configs stored in Git
- Changes reviewed via pull requests
- Environments use versioned Helm charts

ENVIRONMENT SEPARATION
----------------------
- Separate dashboards for staging and production
- No production logs in staging